    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_cereals_grains; processing_state=manufactured): Farinaceous preparations (macaroni, vermicelli, crackers/biscuit, starch, dextrine) belong with Cereals; other starch headings (htc:1561, htc:1572) are already here. Layer-1 observations: 115 rows, 1871–1906. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×115. Units: (no unit) ×105; CWTS (Hundredweights) ×10. Top routes: France → United Kingdom ×8; World → United Kingdom ×8; United States of America → United Kingdom ×8; Germany → United Kingdom ×8."@en ;
